&lt;p&gt;You will lead Brex&#39;s performance marketing strategy and paid media investments, driving customer acquisition, revenue growth, and brand awareness across an expanding portfolio of channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partnering with the Senior Director of Growth Marketing, you will scale an established acquisition engine, build an in-house center of excellence for performance and brand media buying, and lead a growing team of performance marketers. You&#39;ll own the strategy and financial performance of our media investments, balancing near-term revenue outcomes with longer-term demand creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With significant growth investment following Brex&#39;s acquisition by Capital One, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to shape a rapidly expanding media budget, accelerate experimentation across emerging channels, and build more sophisticated measurement capabilities to inform investment decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Brex&#39;s paid media strategy and investment across Brand and Growth, accountable for qualified pipeline, self-serve signups, and the revenue they produce. Brand sets campaign vision and brand KPIs; you turn them into full-funnel media plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize a growing, multimillion-dollar media budget, balancing acquisition volume, LTV, and incremental revenue contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an in-house digital media center of excellence, transitioning brand media buying from a traditional agency model while strategically leveraging platforms and managed services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale existing paid search and paid social programs (LinkedIn, Meta), while expanding investment in YouTube, connected TV, programmatic, and other upper-funnel channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an integrated full-funnel investment strategy, connecting demand creation and brand awareness to downstream acquisition, pipeline, and revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing Operations, Data, and Finance to improve measurement, forecasting, budget pacing, and investment allocation across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate existing attribution and customer journey data into actionable insights, building reporting and analytical frameworks that inform media strategy and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive rapid experimentation across channels, audiences, and creative, identifying opportunities to restructure underperforming campaigns and scale successful investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Brand and Creative teams to develop high-performing static and video advertising, providing actionable feedback on messaging, formats, and creative effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a growing performance marketing team, establishing clear accountability, scalable execution practices, and AI-enabled workflows to increase operating leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in performance marketing, paid acquisition, or digital media, with demonstrated experience scaling multichannel advertising programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing &lt;strong&gt;$30M+ in annual paid media spend&lt;/strong&gt; (~$3M monthly), with measurable impact on customer acquisition and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in performance marketing and acquisition economics, including LTV, ROI, incremental revenue, and revenue-based optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop full-funnel media strategies, connecting upper-funnel brand investments to measurable improvements in downstream demand, conversion, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on expertise in outline video, connected TV, programmatic, and brand media, plus strong paid social experience across LinkedIn and Meta. Working knowledge of paid search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen, including budget ownership, forecasting, investment modeling, and data-driven allocation of spend across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical judgment and experience translating attribution, customer journey, and campaign performance data into actionable investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to assess and improve campaign structure, channel strategy, and creative performance through rigorous testing and rapid iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative judgment, with experience partnering with Brand and Design teams to develop and optimize performance-oriented static and video advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing teams, with a hands-on leadership style and the ability to scale execution without unnecessary organizational complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curious, action-oriented approach to problem-solving, with a track record of challenging existing strategies, making decisions with imperfect information, and executing quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling performance marketing in both high-volume B2C or product-led growth (PLG) environments and B2B, sales-led businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience transitioning media buying from an agency-led model to an in-house team, including evaluating managed-service partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing incrementality testing, media mix modeling, or advanced full-funnel measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, financial services, or high-growth technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI and automation to improve media execution, analysis, and team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
