&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Director, you’ll own a portfolio of high-value accounts within Brex’s Enterprise segment. Your role will be pivotal in fostering business expansion and ensuring sustained client success through disciplined execution, strategic influence, and consultative engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
