&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Analysis &amp;amp; Detection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Mining: Use SQL and Python to mine large-scale data, and apply LLM-based tools to detect and automate the identification of fraudulent patterns across credit, deposit, and card payment rails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor and Rule Optimization: Design and refine automated detection logic to proactively mitigate risk while maintaining a frictionless experience for legitimate customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emerging Threat Intelligence: Stay ahead of industry trends and regulatory shifts to rapidly deploy new defensive strategies against novel fraud vectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Process Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow Architecture: optimize the internal processes for fraud investigations, ensuring operational discipline, case visibility, and high-fidelity documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Serve as the strategic bridge between Risk Leadership, Analytics, Data Science, Engineering, and Product teams to integrate fraud-prevention infrastructure into the core product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; Infrastructure: Define and manage the technical requirements for internal AI-driven tools and third-party risk-reduction platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics, Reporting &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and monitor key performance indicators (KPIs) such as false positive rates, fraud capture rates, and operational turnaround times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Dashboards&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and maintain scalable reporting suites to provide real-time visibility into fraud exposure and program effectiveness for senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact Assessment&lt;/strong&gt;: Conduct deep-dive post-mortems on fraud incidents to quantify financial impact and recommend structural process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Mastery: Capable with SQL and/or Python for data wrangling, statistical modeling, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Experience: 3+ years of experience in fraud strategy, risk operations, or data-driven business operations within a financial services or high-growth fintech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Mindset: Proven ability to build scalable processes and manage complex projects from data exploration through to operational rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
