&lt;li&gt;Negotiate vendor contracts, securing favorable terms and protecting IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Director of Creative Ops to design repeatable processes and tools that enable scale while leaving space for breakthrough creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and remove roadblocks that slow down the creative process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish benchmarks for quality, efficiency, and vendor performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the connective tissue between brand, design, marketing, engineering, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for a culture that balances creative freedom with operational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and persuasively with stakeholders of varying levels of creative fluency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
