&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own sourcing strategy for multiple teams and the orgs behind them, typically partnering with several Directors or VPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement talent mapping and market research for the orgs you support, and secure stakeholder buy-in for the approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomously scope and land ambiguous projects across the team, identifying risks early and mitigating them before they surface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the team’s pitch and build engagement resources other sourcers adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach hiring managers on what the ideal profile looks like for the next stage of their organization, and propose additional assessments or panelists where a loop has gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use reporting to diagnose complex hiring problems and drive the resulting changes through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and modify interview processes to lift conversion or reduce time to fill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously hone the team’s pitch and create engagement resources other sourcers adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor sourcers and enable others to mentor, acting as the go-to expert on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record owning sourcing across multiple teams or a whole org, not a set of individual requisitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering directly with Director- and VP-level stakeholders, including influencing what they search for rather than only executing it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent enough in comp bands and candidate motivation to pre-qualify early and reset unrealistic expectations before a candidate enters a loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has changed how a team sources — a process, a tool, a pitch, a pipeline — and can show what moved as a result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has mentored sourcers or recruiters, and can point to people who grew because of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical market knowledge across engineering, data, product and AI, including where the talent actually sits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in modern sourcing and CRM tooling, and comfortable using data to argue for a change in direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
