&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role will be based in our San Francisco, Seattle, or New York office. We are a hybrid environment that combines the energy and connections of being in the office with the benefits and flexibility of working from home. We currently require a minimum of three coordinated days in the office per week, Monday, Wednesday and Thursday. As a perk, we also have up to four weeks per year of fully remote work!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve Brex’s brand identity system, including visual language, typography, color, illustration, and brand patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain brand standards that balance consistency with creative flexibility across teams and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate company strategy and brand vision into clear, compelling visual direction in partnership with leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver new brand expressions that advance the identity while preserving recognition and equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact brand work beyond the core system, including special campaigns, sub-brands, and select product or service launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Art direct and contribute to brand campaigns, collaborating with external partners and internal teams to ensure exceptional craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and feedback across the organization to raise the quality and effectiveness of brand execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in brand design or art direction, with a strong focus on identity systems and brand evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating strategic thinking, system design, and high-quality execution across identities and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in typography, color, composition, and building scalable visual systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to articulate design decisions and build alignment with cross-functional partners and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple workstreams in fast-paced, evolving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite, with comfort prototyping and iterating quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI tools in the creative process with sound judgment on when and how to apply them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion, video, or illustration experience applied to brand systems or campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience art directing complex brand work with external creative partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
