&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Brex is looking for a Staff brand designer to join the Design team, a cross-disciplinary group of creatives including product designers, brand designers, content design, operations, and marketing strategists. Our team’s mission is to build a category-defining brand and meaningfully move key business metrics by delivering world-class creative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
