&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you’ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;New York&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are a hybrid environment that combines the energy and connections of being in the office with the benefits and flexibility of working from home. We require three days per week in the office—Monday, Wednesday, and Thursday—and offer up to four weeks per year of fully remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
