&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and lead the most consequential technical initiatives across Acquisition Engineering, from first touch through onboarding, activation, and ongoing adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for cross-team systems, including architecture, platform boundaries, reliability, and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM Engineering, Salesforce, Onboarding, and Adoption to simplify handoffs and improve end-to-end customer and operator experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the technical bar through design reviews, hands-on implementation, operational excellence, and pragmatic engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion repeatable, secure, and high-velocity delivery across the group, including strong practices for code review, deployment safety, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a force multiplier by mentoring senior engineers, improving how teams plan and execute, and developing the next generation of technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, data, operations, and go-to-market partners to translate ambiguous business opportunities into scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring an AI-forward mindset to how the group builds customer experiences, internal tooling, and engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
