&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience, with a track record of technical leadership across multiple teams or a large product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to identify and drive ambiguous, cross-cutting problems to resolution without a narrowly defined charter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience designing, building, and operating large-scale backend or full-stack systems in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and business judgment, with the ability to connect technical investments to customer experience, growth, and operational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
